Z||000000||86SE||08-22-2000||02:19 PM||||The first 2 red ones are from right when I got it.  It was pretty beat up.  The last two red ones are from February, after I got nearly all of the parts it was missing or damaged. And all the yellow ones are from late July.  Since these pictues I got my gas cap back, bright yellow with a black ring around the outside.  And I now have YELLOW dash insert pieces.<P> <IMG SRC="http://fierodude.hypermart.net/slideshow.jpg"> <P>This is my first project car.  Got it when I was 14, just finished it after I turned 16.  Im still 16 and my next project is to install a 3.4L engine!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||11
